msgstr ":ref:`Testreszabhatja az űrlapot <website/building_blocks/form>`."

#: ../../content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:132
msgid "When the form is submitted, it automatically creates a project task. The task's content is defined by the form's corresponding fields."
msgstr "Amikor az űrlapot beküldik, az automatikusan létrehoz egy projektfeladatot. A feladat tartalmát az űrlap megfelelő mezői határozzák meg."

#: ../../content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:136
